language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

scenario EditAptCell.
condition EditAptCellReady.
condition EditAptCellContinue.
condition EditAptCellReject.
outcome EditAptCellCompleted.
outcome EditAptCellRejected.
step EditAptCellIntent.
step EditAptCellCorrelate.
step EditAptCellRoute.
step EditAptCellValidate.
step EditAptCellProject.
step EditAptCellPatch.
step EditAptCellResult.
step EditAptCellFailure.
step EditAptCellSuccess.

EditAptCell illustrates ManageAptDefinitions.
EditAptCell exercises ValidatedAptDefinitions.
EditAptCell starts-when EditAptCellReady.
EditAptCell starts-at EditAptCellIntent.
EditAptCellReady describes "An editable draft, stable cell identity and expected revision are present.".
EditAptCellContinue describes "The previous operation succeeded and the next step's declared contract preconditions remain true; exact predicates are an executable-language gap.".
EditAptCellReject describes "Validation, authority, applicability or operation failure prevents continuation; preserve prior valid state and report the specific reason.".
EditAptCellCompleted describes "The stated design path completed under its explicit obligations; this is not an observed test result.".
EditAptCellRejected describes "The path terminated without claiming the requested change succeeded; failures remain observable.".
EditAptCell preserves DomainTruthOwned.
EditAptCell preserves StableCommandIdentity.
EditAptCellIntent calls EmitBoundUserIntent within BuckingUI.
EditAptCellIntent describes "Collect local text then submit typed intent, not optimistic domain truth.".
EditAptCellIntent proceeds-to EditAptCellFailure when EditAptCellReject.
EditAptCellIntent proceeds-to EditAptCellCorrelate when EditAptCellContinue.
EditAptCellCorrelate calls SubmitUiCommand within BuckingUI.
EditAptCellCorrelate describes "Preserve draft/cell/expected revision and command identity.".
EditAptCellCorrelate proceeds-to EditAptCellFailure when EditAptCellReject.
EditAptCellCorrelate proceeds-to EditAptCellRoute when EditAptCellContinue.
EditAptCellRoute calls RouteBrowserCommand within BuckingWeb.
EditAptCellRoute describes "Use authoritative APT endpoint.".
EditAptCellRoute proceeds-to EditAptCellFailure when EditAptCellReject.
EditAptCellRoute proceeds-to EditAptCellValidate when EditAptCellContinue.
EditAptCellValidate calls EditAptDraft within BuckingService.
EditAptCellValidate describes "Validate authority/revision/domain value; reject stale or invalid edit.".
EditAptCellValidate proceeds-to EditAptCellFailure when EditAptCellReject.
EditAptCellValidate proceeds-to EditAptCellProject when EditAptCellContinue.
EditAptCellProject calls ProjectAptAvailability within BuckingUI.
EditAptCellProject describes "Reflect accepted draft revision from authoritative result.".
EditAptCellProject proceeds-to EditAptCellFailure when EditAptCellReject.
EditAptCellProject proceeds-to EditAptCellPatch when EditAptCellContinue.
EditAptCellPatch calls PatchRepresentationCollection within BuckingUI.
EditAptCellPatch describes "Update semantic cell without rebuilding whole schema.".
EditAptCellPatch proceeds-to EditAptCellFailure when EditAptCellReject.
EditAptCellPatch proceeds-to EditAptCellResult when EditAptCellContinue.
EditAptCellResult calls ReconcileUiCommandResult within BuckingUI.
EditAptCellResult describes "Deliver correlated accepted/rejected result to initiating context.".
EditAptCellResult proceeds-to EditAptCellFailure when EditAptCellReject.
EditAptCellResult proceeds-to EditAptCellSuccess when EditAptCellContinue.
EditAptCellFailure finishes EditAptCell with EditAptCellRejected.
EditAptCellSuccess finishes EditAptCell with EditAptCellCompleted.
EditAptCellCorrelate emits OperatorBrowserRequests through OperatorBrowserChannel.
EditAptCellRoute receives OperatorBrowserRequests through OperatorBrowserChannel.
EditAptCellRoute emits BuckingRequests through BuckingServiceUpstream.
EditAptCellValidate receives BuckingRequests through BuckingServiceUpstream.
